msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I have been wandering for a very, very long time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Estou vagando há muito, muito tempo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E8E33C0F_1C5D_4935_86C2_6AEC7C6A29BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5783901fe2bd1be75ca84c77dfcf9f86d96278282b2f52d05e2039e7fb02786
#. default-sha256: d3748fc561840c474d1458271a83dac7c84d451a2cf64c16073f519d93078f16
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E8E33C0F_1C5D_4935_86C2_6AEC7C6A29BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What was that, Master? ⟪k:1⟫You recognize her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O que foi, Mestre? ⟪k:1⟫Você a reconhece?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0789AA8F_5FF4_4FC9_AC02_874445FF7FDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6af5480c81aa354c3b73a67d7200f88573cf0b5581de49bd425a91f5d8dfbd6
#. default-sha256: 1b8a374112a42513fce46324e74aec7551cf548a0cff10f5eb900236d8acfd48
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0789AA8F_5FF4_4FC9_AC02_874445FF7FDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine you would. ⟪k:1⟫That white hair, those red eyes, skin the color of freshly fallen "
"snow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Imaginei que reconheceria. ⟪k:1⟫Esse cabelo branco, esses olhos vermelhos, a pele da cor da "
"neve recém-caída."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2E741487_927A_4B6B_8150_D002B616BB04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2073745ca21187685501a474b4abd9d4b3ab80d0fc554b612f94deed8d963493
#. default-sha256: 2c2e12e94e983b9f72f3c47a843ff95d0ab1471c297a937fd73e8927014a6c3d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2E741487_927A_4B6B_8150_D002B616BB04"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And that flawlessly beautiful visage... ⟪k:1⟫you could not possibly mistake her for anyone "
"else. ⟪k:2⟫And no, it is not someone who happens to resemble her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E aquele rosto perfeitamente lindo...⟪k:1⟫você não poderia confundi-la com mais ninguém. "
"⟪k:2⟫E não, não é alguém que pelo acaso se parece com ela."

#: scenario2:scenario2_58773568_08FB_4D1E_82D8_4F1AA27D2A86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5431f74ac0ba1346100c47e0dbb79d7f67a670b3e88179bd79c17f29681b928
#. default-sha256: 18cd043b969b94daae7eccd588dcd0e7e766e203724bd5d68bb2d83454fa7908
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_58773568_08FB_4D1E_82D8_4F1AA27D2A86"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I can understand why you would be surprised, Master. ⟪k:1⟫At first, I could hardly believe "
"my own eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu posso entender o porquê de você ficar surpreso, Mestre. ⟪k:1⟫No começo, eu mal podia "
"acreditar em meus próprios olhos."

#: scenario2:scenario2_DE5B9B47_1A1E_40BC_B96E_D4A5B1CFF55C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06d2265d84331e3358abd2486e03f6de5021cfe4195416f22a19821e997ca712
#. default-sha256: 693819aaaea7bf5adf46891d8c9ddd4fb84b85afce3706d36666478cde7b3cdb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DE5B9B47_1A1E_40BC_B96E_D4A5B1CFF55C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The wanderer knocking on the door that day was the very same fair-skinned young woman who "
"visited the mansion so many years earlier."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O andarilho que batia na porta naquele dia era a mesma jovem de pele clara que havia "
"visitado a mansão tantos anos antes."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A12E6328_D57E_43F8_BB1B_8C4C5F88215D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0994c664df6a513209f421338ba10395058a7d800be1c075f53969e9a072d4c2
#. default-sha256: c91c664475a7703bc3a4df64cff9c0b59b03810d66b911b911d446c599254fce
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A12E6328_D57E_43F8_BB1B_8C4C5F88215D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl must have spent many, many a night in the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A Garota de Cabelos Brancos deve ter passado muitas, muitas noites na floresta."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E877D490_31D4_4AAE_A8F4_3729423D1083
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59f1c18e1299442f460693410bfa9347174587226a625d87c49b8988b6b88f36
#. default-sha256: 8fa96ed4a6981509779a8b87a682aad0f73be493b8138ba41ae475701889207e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E877D490_31D4_4AAE_A8F4_3729423D1083"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her crystalline skin was covered in red scratches from where she had brushed against stray "
"branches and tree bark. She had even lost her shoes, and was standing there barefooted, looking "
"quite disheartened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sua pele cristalina estava coberta de arranhões vermelhos de onde ela havia roçado em galhos "
"soltos e casca de árvore. Ela tinha até perdido os sapatos e estava ali descalça, parecendo "
"bastante abatida."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CBB6BF74_20E5_4572_B7D3_72A11D316931
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c01f84327c1b8d7dd5ad2cdf26805ad8829856c3445347256bf42596fca5af2d
#. default-sha256: 9d73c26a7de0c940f0dba89fa255c7839ee6515ce5695f1dfb6ac66cf4f2dfa8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CBB6BF74_20E5_4572_B7D3_72A11D316931"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that did not make her any less beautiful. In fact, you could just imagine the dense "
"forest canopy parting to allow the sun to shine down upon her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas isso não a tornava menos bonita. Na verdade, dá até para imaginar a abóboda da floresta "
"se abrindo para permitir que o sol brilhe sobre ela."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F2F71829_F774_4155_83C7_9178873C2A08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3beecc3ecb541d1d16f6cce38fd006b6677157a09cecc1e86de08b42f786da9
#. default-sha256: 1c812955ab9bac78e3a90e06d812791e1961c834f796f1436b7f9a497f0f3238
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F2F71829_F774_4155_83C7_9178873C2A08"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9F0927F3_EB0A_49F1_8830_CBE0CA231BCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9352c22629860de86650fe6b91b9c5c2f2c1ac8aec589c30f9b53810267058cf
#. default-sha256: 9d16bea2803c8aab59e15efbdc0d85165689d7856ebaedfd98f5bb45edf09532
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9F0927F3_EB0A_49F1_8830_CBE0CA231BCA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The beast appeared surprised by her angelic beauty as well. ⟪k:1⟫It seemed as though all the "
"madness drained from him in that moment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A fera também parecia surpresa com sua beleza angelical. ⟪k:1⟫Parecia que toda a loucura foi "
"drenada dele naquele momento."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6EF0A4AB_CE19_4C16_9E79_AFFE0E0D292A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cadbcb08fbd930be85c33b19dc96b2eefbc804e8cfc46e4a5816cbdb741b5abf
#. default-sha256: 73240080bf46069c38289e19b43c8d9b2ccd9eb4857ef2fde459e62c16247d8d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6EF0A4AB_CE19_4C16_9E79_AFFE0E0D292A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫....................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫....................."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6D4B969B_BC5B_41D1_90C0_4EC4FFA290FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2968d7bbc9c7a62349c60a8ec0d9dcd891a758b03bc792647d5df846e809b1bf
#. default-sha256: 445a21b0c20e77e357b00e8540ff0fbaebcd34e87a42b089e342011a55e5f5ea
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6D4B969B_BC5B_41D1_90C0_4EC4FFA290FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He said nothing, but his eyes told all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ele não disse nada, mas seus olhos diziam tudo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_856FAEE0_BDA3_42B9_8042_E2231EE27056
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d0cc082b066a19f9c7f30c4a9c34cea43d9268a309269e6264b1788b5cada51
#. default-sha256: 2f1ca873f86cd9870b0bc94537c6aeed3c9ceb326e3f4d9363a9d40145f7293d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_856FAEE0_BDA3_42B9_8042_E2231EE27056"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was entranced by the sight of her ruby-red irises and her pure-white hair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ele ficou encantado com a visão de suas íris vermelho-rubi e seu cabelo branco puro."

#: scenario2:scenario2_946B9368_56E5_4E47_A332_72BA658DC90A
