msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7CC04AB0_BDC5_4F3D_BD21_1CD11CB78737"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Taken in the throes of his primal urges, the beast had not noticed, but there was an "
"emptiness in the girl’s eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tomado pelos espasmos de seus impulsos primitivos, a fera não percebeu, mas havia um vazio "
"nos olhos da garota."

#: scenario2:scenario2_651C1431_471A_41B0_B289_FA29C125ADDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75c257c1f07d2401670d2d0a36a8456ee92d0b8d21f8736160e6398a75e2bdb3
#. default-sha256: 79b0e89ef2bb385c3f162dc26deccf3c6b114439ce2a09c4e2526c8dcfbd321c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_651C1431_471A_41B0_B289_FA29C125ADDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She appeared to be gazing far into the distance, not focused on the man despite being close "
"enough to touch him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela parecia estar olhando para longe, não focada no homem apesar de estar perto o suficiente "
"para tocá-lo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2B91BD3B_8E75_43F8_A27C_2C9A1CE8968A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3aedbec18af611d9d49bfa8727665fcf53eb2b3648fa4344a1186712abbc259
#. default-sha256: d89c5b0f14066b30189fd233c498f760ca0faf97baff314bc045de14086ff318
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2B91BD3B_8E75_43F8_A27C_2C9A1CE8968A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tears had begun running down Bestia’s cheeks earlier—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫when she had called him a "
"person."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais cedo, lágrimas começaram a escorrer pelas bochechas de Bestia—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫quando ela o "
"chamou de ser humano."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A8CC8189_A609_4FA4_8E7B_3113430A1ED6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b85772ad26c2bc0c9beb45948beeadf3e5f4e74ba2d627c118ed52c2c5bc529
#. default-sha256: 657b0d7f27ee696ebf42cfdea1d25761e0d636c2f8fb9b898bf2ab0e8af87046
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A8CC8189_A609_4FA4_8E7B_3113430A1ED6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not until one of those droplets had slid across the back of her finger that she "
"had realized."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas foi só quando uma dessas gotículas deslizou na parte de trás de seu dedo que ela "
"percebeu."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BD87C6E1_2308_4BB1_B95E_E41A9B2AD812
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c73e9ffb36a97351338d9c63bf07915d07d4890d877438822ef7fec3136f0a40
#. default-sha256: bc1ea93beb0d2c95f6c1c9a368c013573a203ed2d87fa18b45faccc6d288ff23
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BD87C6E1_2308_4BB1_B95E_E41A9B2AD812"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She would, indeed, have no need of extravagant dresses—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫after all, she could not "
"see what she was wearing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela, de fato, não precisava de vestidos extravagantes...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫afinal, ela não podia ver "
"o que estava vestindo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_645A19A9_4D1A_45F3_8D14_DF9B0BBD9175
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8468dd95694dc5401c06bc1eda3c8a0b985b4f5fd1a4176b1f87c54f51eb3a8a
#. default-sha256: 7cacbbdb8c75e5be480f3e9fe9418905479d2fba8aedc8f2626ca8aea423e752
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_645A19A9_4D1A_45F3_8D14_DF9B0BBD9175"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That is correct; I am blind...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But who ever decided that reality is only that which "
"can be seen?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você está certo; eu sou cega...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mas quem decidiu que a realidade é apenas aquilo "
"que pode ser visto?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3520CD30_9B22_4B24_A869_88E7B38DC357
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3039173142874b5d66ac0acdc574c01c89b4c4466f74699f51a610030bb26ab
#. default-sha256: 727413e40f7771930f3502ddeb065ecc5e4ee434aa213ea5e60797441613eefb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3520CD30_9B22_4B24_A869_88E7B38DC357"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I know not what appearance I have."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não sei que aparência tenho."

#: scenario2:scenario2_590045A2_5DA3_4579_A391_E1875D295C2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f5cfd1e3c21562f1ae8c8ee6e3ca3fbdea885627fb557af2c2839b926f852b7
#. default-sha256: fb9bb9a02aa2c1c6fb5cba692de463c8353261df14f750f46612eaa4ac319802
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_590045A2_5DA3_4579_A391_E1875D295C2A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In the darkness, everything is as one;⟪k:1⟫there is no difference between beast and man.⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫If you are a beast, then I too must be a beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Na escuridão, tudo é como um só;⟪k:1⟫não há diferença entre besta e homem.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Se você "
"é uma fera, então eu também devo ser uma fera."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D4A42BCC_B63F_4D0F_946B_5E2A96A08F12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9083d89f83e52e4de20067ac25339c120f7bc27520d1048f94416eedfd6e995
#. default-sha256: e29f437c19df4286b87909bd559299f374df152aa4b8141f697b3a83d562e9c3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D4A42BCC_B63F_4D0F_946B_5E2A96A08F12"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To call the girl a beast would be paramount to eating sugar and insisting it was salt."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Chamar a menina de fera seria como comer açúcar e insistir que era sal."

#: scenario2:scenario2_67032F47_2055_44A8_ABA4_DAA196713B97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1627dfb83942750d25523a89be2ae3b8c1779b68786c1edc902c1c2a3f180c81
#. default-sha256: 1423ee649f44fc19e07762537088de050a8d8d3c875993328a0cfb2280e70bef
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_67032F47_2055_44A8_ABA4_DAA196713B97"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Do pardon the trite analogy, please."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Perdoe a analogia banal, por favor."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C28C27E1_5C6E_40FF_9B28_D04C6F0819BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c8923c80b5b309232d62bac3a906bc1d5a343e397de6dda07f12e15135a2fa9
#. default-sha256: 7ba765555b60c1cd409c198c400f28b17e33905d5c5cf9b3509737a62044abeb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C28C27E1_5C6E_40FF_9B28_D04C6F0819BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But you know rather well, Master, that the White-Haired Girl was not at all what you would "
"call a beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas você sabe muito bem, Mestre, que a Garota de Cabelos Brancos não se assemelhava a nada "
"que você chamaria de fera."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C5F8E918_0E88_4054_BC3A_7461BBBD5E9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 960cd0b7e80f15f5b5bce326f596226ea615aabbba9170aa87ccd70a8923286f
#. default-sha256: b16da6e48e391d6134d4943ff09f6101c9c8fdc42ed2d1620331e2d86736f368
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C5F8E918_0E88_4054_BC3A_7461BBBD5E9E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not simply in appearance, but all the way down to her core. There was nothing beastly about "
"her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não apenas na aparência, mas em tudo o que a representava. Não havia nada de bestial nela."

