#: scenario2:scenario2_14B4EFA8_4CDC_4E77_9678_C64085275876
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18f3bb9f7020b63cfe12f6e1e36019cd633c29afbda1eabcd3acd4c4f0eae609
