msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_14B4EFA8_4CDC_4E77_9678_C64085275876"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her words brought him faint pain, but the beast still felt, on some level, that he wanted to "
"keep her at his side. To see what would happen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫As palavras dela lhe trouxeram uma leve dor, mas a fera ainda sentia, em algum nível, que "
"ele queria mantê-la ao seu lado. Para ver o que aconteceria."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1DBC9231_F152_4E0A_9F32_4372EB81F449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12d764976a097e28e57f75d5af2b6f7c6bea7fcc7a13eff123b39510e9b2e138
